  "notes": [
    "Blackwater now randomly chooses the Repeater or the newly approved Reaver for each hunter slot. Everyone in a co-op run sees the same selection; hunter counts and difficulty rules are unchanged.",
    "The Reaver brings its layered charcoal armor, horn crown, recessed red eyes and hooked claws into the actual game, with baked Blender materials and authored idle, walk, run and three attack animations.",
    "Reaver attack poses follow the real strike window, with moving legs during an advancing attack. Both Blackwater creatures share the existing sound-driven hunting, physical collision and cover rules.",
    "Blackwater has stronger drifting smoke through the corridors, with darker near-camera space and practical-light scattering. Lower graphics settings retain a restrained depth-haze fallback.",
    "Windows 10/11 x64. Close the game, choose Check for updates, then Update & restart. Everyone in a co-op group should update."
  ],
